# Binary Opposition: a 1 and a 0 -- and, turned about, a 1 and a 0 again.

NAME Binary Opposition
SYMMETRY ROT2
WALLS K Y
START 61 12 S
TUNNELS                        # mouths mid-edge; drive through to the far side

# The 1: a stem with a flag at its top.
MOVE 6 4
DRAW 8 4
DRAW 8 12

# The 0, open at one side.
MOVE 26 5
DRAW 22 5
DRAW 22 12
DRAW 26 12
